WEBVTT

00:00:46.160 --> 00:00:48.820
A notice of special interest to farmers.

00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:54.650
A fruit fly mutation has escaped from the United States Agricultural Research Laboratory.

00:00:54.650 --> 00:00:59.640
The fly is reported to be unusually strong and very destructive.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.590
Farmers are warned to be on the lookout for this pest.

00:01:03.590 --> 00:01:05.960
It is particularly fond of apples.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:01.350
- Okay.

00:05:03.610 --> 00:05:04.100
.
